&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in New Business SaaS Sales, preferably in enterprise FinTech/Treasury Management Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated large account navigation and complex sales cycle management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to position functionally rich, sophisticated value propositions across multiple business areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to execute pipeline generation at scale through outbound, driving and maintaining a 4x pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent track record of top sales performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent value based, consultative selling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven organizational and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel 25-50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business or equivalent experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
